# Browser-profile scratch is written to `os.tmpdir()` by the scripts that launch Chrome,
# so nothing a normal run creates matches these patterns any more. They stay as a
# backstop: `BENCH_PROFILE_DIR` can still point back into the repo, and a profile left
# here is 100-270 MB of cache plus a real browser's history and cookies.
